[ti:E0062-1 The World Behind the Curtain]
[length:02:04]
[00:31.29]Who
[00:31.53]are you?
[00:32.01]The world
[00:32.65]is full of secrets
[00:36.68]Those with eyes will see
[00:40.17]Those with ears will hear
[00:43.29]Not the imitation made by others
[00:47.13]But eyes and ears made by yourself
[00:50.81]Then behind the world you see
[00:54.17]The true faces and sounds
[00:57.85]You will see and hear
[01:02.81]Without losing your mind
[01:07.24]You cannot find
[01:10.20]That secret
[01:12.20]Reciting a script
[01:14.68]Written by someone else
[01:18.92]Like a parrot
[01:22.50]Just living as if it were your own
[01:33.43]The world
[01:36.31]is full of secrets
[01:39.50]Can you see
[01:41.50]Can you hear
[01:43.26]Can you face
[01:44.94]The real you
[01:46.86]The world
[01:50.20]is still full of secrets
